     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nDear all,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\napologies for an atypical posting here, but Mike Meredith&#39;s Obituary was just published :\r\n<a href=\"https://conbio.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1111/csp2.12979\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://conbio.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1111/csp2.12979&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792448916497000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2OJX7T9N18cbL1etliw7eB\">\r\nhttps://conbio.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1111/csp2.12979</a><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nMike was an outstanding character and his contributions to what people in these lists do were huge, although for the most part silent and behind the scenes. I count myself privileged to have spent at least a little bit of time with this &quot;unsung hero&quot;.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nBest regards  --- Marc<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
